VD-uni CLI commands

1) Download
./scripts/vd download "<url>"

Example:
./scripts/vd download "https://youtube.com/watch?v=sayebOQcWew"

2) Export cookies
./scripts/vd cookies --browser <chrome|chromium|brave|firefox> --domain <domain>

Examples:
./scripts/vd cookies --browser chrome --domain youtube.com
./scripts/vd cookies --browser brave --domain x.com
./scripts/vd cookies --browser firefox --domain pornhub.com

3) Update tools (also bumps VERSION patch)
./scripts/vd-update

4) Version
./scripts/vd version
./scripts/vd version --bump <major|minor|patch>

Notes
- Downloads go to: /home/khamani808/VD-uni/downloads
- GUI launcher: ./scripts/vd-gui
- Per-site cookies go to: /home/khamani808/VD-uni/config/cookies/<domain>.txt
